<title>MEXICO: Telmex issues second tranche of notes.</title>
<headline>Telmex issues second tranche of notes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican telephone company Telefonos de Mexico SA (Telmex) on Wednesday issued the second and final tranche of its medium-term notes (pagares) worth 500 million pesos.</p>
<p>Telmex in April issued some 4.5 billion pesos of the notes. It had been authorized to issue a total of 5 billion pesos.</p>
<p>Telmex said in newspaper announcements the offer was valid on May 14 and 15. The notes come due on April 13, 2000 and are rated MXAAA by Standard &amp; Poor's.</p>
<p>(( -- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
